WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Wait

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,560
I seem to be growing brains for them

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,800
From enemies to allies

4
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:11,100
Who is the dead cat?

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,580
I'm so angry

6
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,220
Let you stay away

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,500
Who asked you to team up with him?

8
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,570
The Son of God of your clan

9
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:22,170
It seems that I was convinced by the Holy Son of my sect.

10
00:00:23,770 --> 00:00:36,100
It's not good for you to shut up, you don't look at it

11
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:37,580
Blood God Son of Blood God Mansion

12
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,820
How did you come out of the sealed passage?

13
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:53,770
You actually colluded with Warcraft. Calm down.

14
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,370
I have never colluded with God's benevolent monsters

15
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:59,490
There is a traitor in our clan. Stop fighting now.

16
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:01,970
This Blood God Fairy can crush all the celestial spheres by herself

17
00:01:02,170 --> 00:01:03,290
None of them can beat him

18
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,970
They're all going to die here
